### LEAD 6: work.threema.ch session fixation

**Source hypothesis:** Pre-auth `__HOST-HTTP-SESSIONID` cookie set on initial 301; if not rotated post-login, fixation possible. Confidence: 55.

| Q | Answer | Reasoning |
|---|--------|-----------|
| Q1 | YES | `work.threema.ch` in scope. |
| Q2 | Potentially | Requires AUTH_HELPED (credentials) to verify post-login cookie rotation. |
| Q3 | — | Cannot assess without violating passive-first. |
| Q4 | **NO** | Requires AUTH_HELPED credentials to compare pre/post-login cookies. Violates passive-first. |
| Q5 | — | — |
| Q6 | — | — |
| Q7 | — | — |

**Verdict: HOLD** — Requires AUTH_HELPED credentials to verify; violates passive-first rule. Cannot triage without program-provided test account.

