| Q4 | **NO** | Endpoint confirmed 404; also requires AUTH_HELPED. |
| Q5 | — | — |
| Q6 | — | — |
| Q7 | — | — |

**Verdict: INVALID** — Endpoint returns 404 (not publicly routable); requires AUTH_HELPED; speculative.

