## HOLD Items — Required Action

To advance the 2 HOLD items, the program must provide:

1. **LEAD 6 (session fixation):** A low-privilege test account on `work.threema.ch` so pre/post-login cookie rotation can be compared passively.
2. **LEAD 8 (Work cross-subscription):** An authorized Work test license to probe `/identities` membership filtering.

Without program-furnished test credentials, both remain unverifiable under passive-first rules and should not be reported.

